  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:15.850" end="00:17.940" ttm:agent="v1">I need like two, three thots</p>
      <p begin="00:17.940" end="00:19.840" ttm:agent="v1">We letting off two, three shots</p>
      <p begin="00:19.840" end="00:21.980" ttm:agent="v1">Make that boy jump, Kris Kross</p>
      <p begin="00:21.980" end="00:24.150" ttm:agent="v1">He want that smoke not pop</p>
      <p begin="00:24.150" end="00:25.910" ttm:agent="v1">I'm getting the bag, I get it a lot</p>
      <p begin="00:25.910" end="00:27.870" ttm:agent="v1">Not only the heat but I came with the guap</p>
      <p begin="00:27.870" end="00:30.020" ttm:agent="v1">Mess with my steez and you getting shot</p>
      <p begin="00:30.020" end="00:32.420" ttm:agent="v1">Baggage on me choppa, no stock</p>
      <p begin="00:32.420" end="00:34.540" ttm:agent="v1">I need like two, three thots</p>
      <p begin="00:34.540" end="00:36.470" ttm:agent="v1">We letting off two, three shots</p>
      <p begin="00:36.470" end="00:38.370" ttm:agent="v1">Make that boy jump, Kris Kross</p>
      <p begin="00:38.370" end="00:40.800" ttm:agent="v1">He want that smoke not pop</p>
      <p begin="00:40.800" end="00:42.380" ttm:agent="v1">I'm getting the bag, I get it a lot</p>
      <p begin="00:42.380" end="00:44.720" ttm:agent="v1">Not only the heat but I came with the guap</p>
      <p begin="00:44.720" end="00:46.520" ttm:agent="v1">Mess with my steez and you getting shot</p>
      <p begin="00:46.520" end="00:48.790" ttm:agent="v1">Baggage on me choppa, no stock</p>
      <p begin="00:48.790" end="00:50.890" ttm:agent="v1">Choppa aimed at you, go, bang</p>
      <p begin="00:50.890" end="00:53.000" ttm:agent="v1">Like Trippie, I make that bitch sang</p>
      <p begin="00:53.000" end="00:54.600" ttm:agent="v1">I cannot mess with these fakes</p>
      <p begin="00:54.600" end="00:57.060" ttm:agent="v1">Who screaming my name when they see me get fame</p>
      <p begin="00:57.060" end="00:59.140" ttm:agent="v1">Don't ever hit up my line</p>
      <p begin="00:59.140" end="01:01.360" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I just will not reply</p>
      <p begin="01:01.360" end="01:03.130" ttm:agent="v1">Only my brothers and that's on my mother</p>
      <p begin="01:03.130" end="01:05.050" ttm:agent="v1">Shoutout Letoa, you're my slime</p>
      <p begin="01:05.050" end="01:07.260" ttm:agent="v1">I came with a glock and came with a nine</p>
      <p begin="01:07.260" end="01:09.390" ttm:agent="v1">Go blah, blah, blah, when I shoot it one time</p>
      <p begin="01:09.390" end="01:11.570" ttm:agent="v1">Shoutout to Bubblegum, you're my slime</p>
      <p begin="01:11.570" end="01:13.660" ttm:agent="v1">All about the gaup on the way to my prime</p>
      <p begin="01:13.660" end="01:15.780" ttm:agent="v1">I been on the money way getting no sleep</p>
      <p begin="01:15.780" end="01:17.960" ttm:agent="v1">All my fuckin' family say, &quot;I'm in too deep&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:17.960" end="01:19.520" ttm:agent="v1">I can't really see, I've been in 2D</p>
      <p begin="01:19.520" end="01:21.910" ttm:agent="v1">But I've been making moves like I'm in a movie</p>
      <p begin="01:21.910" end="01:23.850" ttm:agent="v1">I need like two, three thots</p>
      <p begin="01:23.850" end="01:26.040" ttm:agent="v1">We letting off two, three shots</p>
